  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 801.01 Purpose and Scope. The provisions of this chapter shall apply to, and impose duties upon, all pharmacy technicians holding registrations or certifications issued by the board.\n\nSource. #7535, eff 7-25-01, EXPIRED: 7-25-09\n\nNew. #10720, eff 11-22-14; ss by #12671, eff 11-7-18",
